1200 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: This song is just perfect for your voice, David.\Now, I was thinking about giving it a House arrangement.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: House? Hmmm... I guess David could pull that off, now. Besides, it IS a\good idea to try different things. We don't want our fans to get tired of\us.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: Then I'll get working on that ASAP. I want it to be ready for our\London performance.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: I don't know Martin, this studio's got nothing on the equipment we\have in London. Right, Andrew?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1240 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: Honestly, I just want to leave Germany and go back home.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Look at you. A few rounds of bad gambling and you're homesick.\Whoops. We promised not to talk about gambling.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: Anyway! Let's think about the arrangement when we're back in\London. For now, let's keep practicing.\Tomorrow's the big day, so don't push yourself, David.":GOSUB 5100
1270 COMMON FO:BM$="After finishing their practice, the band returned to the hotel.":GOSUB 5100
1280 GOSUB 6110:BM$="Clark and Vince were inside a car parked behind the hotel, tailing\Susanna's movements as usual.":GOSUB 5100
