1510 COMMON FOF:GOSUB 9535:GOSUB 6125:BM$="As Clark and Vince drove off, David was in his room, the lights turned off.\He was focusing on the silhouette of his hand, trying to perceive that\aura once more.":GOSUB 5100
1520 GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 9050:GOSUB 6120:BM$="He really wanted to see what happened to Hroth, the man who looked so\much like him. He couldn't bear to stay one second longer than necessary\in that studio.":GOSUB 5100
1530 GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 6140:BM$="Finally, his focus paid off. A white dot appeared in the darkness, slowly\becoming larger and larger, until he could see a scenery projected on the\ceiling.":GOSUB 5100
1535 GOSUB 6900:GOSUB 6150:BM$="He saw the castle from the previous night...but it was surrounded by an\army, and engulfed in flames.":GOSUB 5100
1536 GOSUB 6900
1540 GOSUB 6160:BM$="The images changed. He could see a stone passage. There was King Hroth,\held up by Lafir and a woman.":GOSUB 5100
1550 BM$="David was startled by what he saw: the woman was a dead ringer for\Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
